/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The platform thrives on data, transforming statistics, game insights, and player performances into meaningful, actionable choices for millions of sports enthusiasts. At Dream11, they leverage cutting-edge AI and machine learning \(ML\) technologies to enhance user experience, from team creation to gameplay predictions. Through Inter IIT Tech Meet, they invite you to take on a real-world challenge and contribute to the future of fantasy sports.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [5]
